  "psp-tactics-ogre-let-us-cling-together": "Tactics Ogre: Let Us Cling Together remakes the strategy classic with deep class systems, branching choices, and the World Tarot rewind structure. It is a premium PSP tactics release.",
  "psp-wipeout-pure": "Wipeout Pure brings Sony's anti-gravity racing to PSP with sleek tracks, electronic style, and fast portable racing. It was one of the system's strongest launch-era showcases.",
  "psp-wipeout-pulse": "Wipeout Pulse refines the PSP racing formula with new tracks, grids, ships, and online-era features. It is a strong follow-up for collectors of Sony racing games.",
  "psp-daxter": "Daxter gives the Jak and Daxter sidekick a polished PSP platform adventure with bug-spraying tools, city exploration, and impressive handheld production values.",
  "psp-ratchet-and-clank-size-matters": "Ratchet & Clank: Size Matters condenses Insomniac-style weapon upgrading, platforming, and humor into a portable adventure. It is a key PSP entry for PlayStation platforming collectors.",
