  "psp-ridge-racer": "Ridge Racer on PSP delivers slick drift racing, bright visuals, and a greatest-hits approach to Namco's arcade racing history. It was a standout launch title.",
  "psp-castlevania-the-dracula-x-chronicles": "Castlevania: The Dracula X Chronicles packages a 2.5D remake of Rondo of Blood with unlockable classic Rondo and Symphony of the Night, making it a major collector release.",
  "psp-mega-man-powered-up": "Mega Man Powered Up remakes the original Mega Man with chibi visuals, new modes, playable bosses, and level creation. It is a distinctive PSP Capcom release.",
